"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">승강기 사용 자제</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">정전 및 복전 전</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">？</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">후 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">10</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">분</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">). </span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
